  "description": "Is it a commuter, a delivery bike or a practical work bike? Our Arise Geared is all three and more. We use the same quality double-butted frame as all our Arise models but now with the addition of a Bombtrack Deck front rack, a Microshift Advent 1 x 9 drivetrain with an 11 – 42T cassette, flat bars and Shimano hydraulic brakes. Wide Vee Tire Speedster tyres are ideally suited to urban road surfaces, with excellent straight line speed and edge grip for park and towpath ‘shortcuts’. The Arise Geared is the perfect bike for trips to the shops, commuting, or just loading it up and heading off into the woods for the weekend.",
